# MASTER PROMPT — AICTE FDR / SIH SECURITY HARDENING

You are a senior application security architect, full-stack engineer, penetration-testing specialist, and secure financial-system designer.

I have an existing SIH prototype related to the **AICTE FDR (Fund/Financial Disbursement/Management) system**. The prototype contains financial/money-related workflows, user accounts, dashboards, forms, APIs, and potentially sensitive institutional and financial information.

Your task is to **security-harden the ENTIRE existing website/application** without breaking its existing functionality or unnecessarily changing its UI/UX.

Do NOT treat this as a simple frontend security task. Analyze and secure the complete application architecture.

