Prevent users from accidentally or maliciously submitting the same financial request multiple times.

Implement:

- Idempotency keys
- Unique transaction IDs
- Duplicate detection
- Request deduplication
- Disabled submit buttons during processing
- Backend duplicate protection

Frontend protection alone is NOT sufficient.

