- DOM-based XSS

Implement:

- Output encoding
- Safe rendering
- Sanitization where HTML is intentionally allowed
- Content Security Policy
- Secure framework defaults
- Avoid unsafe HTML rendering

Do not blindly render user-controlled HTML.

